<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Ahmsa making torsion bars.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Ahmsa making torsion bars.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monterrey-based steel-maker Altos Hornos de Mexico (Ahmsa) has begun manufacturing steel torsion bars for automobile suspensions, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said in a communique that it has capacity to build 2,000 tonnes a month of the bars.</p>
<p>-- Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7677</p>
